 gap-[12px] s:gap-[10px]"><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Jul 7, 2026</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">EdgeBench: Measuring Real-World Environment Learning and Discovering a New Scaling Law</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">Agents exhibit a clear log-sigmoid pattern in environment learning.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Dec 2, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">GR-RL: A Breakthrough in Dexterous Manipulation, Achieving the First Real-Robot Shoe Lacing with Reinforcement Learning</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">Enabling VLA models to learn through real-world interaction.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Jul 22, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">Seed Research ￨ GR-3 Released: A Generalist Robot Model for Generalization, Long-Horizon Tasks, and Bi-Manual Deformable Object Manipulation</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">A generalizable robot operation model that supports long-range and complex tasks.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Jul 15, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">Seed&#x27;s Open-Source RL Recipe Makes 4B Model Rival 235B on Math Reasoning</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">700 steps of RL training enhances the math reasoning power of small models.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">May 28, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">Seed Research｜BAGEL: The Open-Source Unified Multimodal Model - An All-in-One Model!</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">Supports text, images, videos, and multimodal interleaving.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Apr 17, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">ByteDance Seed Agent Model UI-TARS-1.5 Open Source: Achieving SOTA Performance in Various Benchmarks</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">Adds a game scenario supporting up to 1000 interactions.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Apr 14, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">Multi-SWE-bench: First Multilingual Code Fix Benchmark Open Source</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">All data is sourced from GitHub issues, constructed over nearly a year.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Mar 4, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">Doubao (Seed) Team Launched SuperGPQA— an Open-source Benchmark Test Set Covering 285 Disciplines</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">After half a year of development, we are finally filling the gap in long-tail knowledge evaluation.</span></div></div><div class="group flex min-h-[80px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-[100px] rounded-[20px] px-[30px] transition-colors duration-200 hover:rounded-[12px] hover:bg-white m:min-h-0 m:flex-col m:items-start m:gap-[16px] m:rounded-[12px] m:bg-white/50 m:p-[10px] m:hover:bg-white/50 ms:min-h-[60px] ms:flex-row ms:items-center ms:gap-[100px] ms:rounded-[20px] ms:bg-transparent ms:px-[30px] ms:py-0 ms:hover:rounded-[12px] ms:hover:bg-white"><span class="w-[100px] shrink-0 text-[16px] font-[400] leading-[21px] text-[#212121]/50 s:order-2 s:w-auto m:text-[14px] m:leading-[18px] ms:w-[120px]">Feb 25, 2025</span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-[10px] s:order-1 s:w-full"><span class="text-[16px] font-[400] text-[#212121] m:text-[14px]">Seed Research | New SOTA in Formal Mathematical Reasoning! BFS-Prover Model Now Open Sourced</span><span class="truncate text-[14px] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50 tracking-[0.28px]">Simplify the complex and encourage the machine to think deeply!</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main></div><div style="background:#f7f7f7"><footer class="font-text bg-[#F8F8F8] text-[#212121] transition-all duration-300 ease-b origin-bottom transform-gpu [body.menu-open_&amp;]:blur-[8px] [body.menu-open_&amp;]:scale-x-[98%]"><div class="hidden pc1280:block relative h-[480px] overflow-hidden bg-[#F8F8F8]" style="background:radial-gradient(134.01% 77.59% at 50% 20.04%, rgba(200, 221, 233, 0.00) 51.85%, rgba(165, 197, 230, 0.57) 100%);background-image:url(https://lf3-static.bytednsdoc.com/obj/eden-cn/lapzild-tss/ljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp/banner/footerv3.png);background-size:100%, 100%;background-position:bottom;background-repeat:no-repeat"><div class="relative top-[43px] z-[1] flex h-[400px] flex-col justify-between pc1280:mx-auto pc1280:px-0 pc1280:w-[1200px]